- electron/school-browser.ts: app-managed persistent Chromium on :9333
  (ms-playwright binary, ~/.hermes/browser_auth/school-profile), CDP relay
  over IPC — screencast frames out, allowlisted input/navigation in,
  HTTP tab create/close/activate
- BrowserMirror: rail tab with the browser's own mini tab strip, URL bar,
  back/forward/reload, live JPEG mirror, full mouse+keyboard forwarding
  (logins typed in-panel), offline empty-state with Start browser
- rail plumbing: RIGHT_RAIL_BROWSER_TAB_ID + $browserRailOpen, pane gates
  in desktop-controller now count the browser tab, cmd+w closes it
- auto-open: use-agent-browser-watcher pops the mirror when a turn starts
  using browser_* tools; Sources header gains a Browser opener
- agent side: config.yaml browser.cdp_url -> the same :9333 browser, so
  the mirror shows the agent working live (verified: PubMed search E2E)
